      "title_zh": "Meta 发布终端编程智能体 Muse Code 测试版，搭载全新 Muse Spark 1.2 模型",
      "title_orig": "RT Mark Zuckerberg: Releasing Muse Code in beta today. It's a terminal coding agent that takes on complete software engineering tasks across large rep...",
