      "title_zh": "Alexandr Wang 宣布 Muse Code 测试版上线，作为首个基于 Muse Spark 1.2 构建的编程智能体，用户可通过命令行安装。",
      "title_orig": "RT Alexandr Wang: muse code in beta is live. first coding agent from msl, built on muse spark 1.2. install: curl -fsS https://dev.meta.ai/install.sh |...",
